Package: UrbanFarmDashboard
Title: Urban Farm Task Management Dashboard
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Urban Farm", "Team", email = "farm@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An RShiny dashboard application for managing urban farm tasks,
    with a focus on chicken management and hazard tracking. This application
    provides tools for monitoring livestock health, tracking farm hazards,
    and managing day-to-day farm operations.
